		(descr "MP1584EN adjustable buck module, HW-133A~F clone (silkscreen: 降压模块 / 输入 / 输出). 4 nets, each broken out to 2 redundant through-holes at 0.1in pitch: VIN-/VIN+ on one edge, VOUT-/VOUT+ on the opposite edge, 0.7in apart; the two net pairs on each edge are 0.3in apart center-to-center. Measured by owner with a ruler (input/output edge spacing and pair pitch only -- +/-0.5mm). Board outline below is NOT measured -- it is a generous placeholder box around the hole pattern for visual reference only. Pad numbers match the Uncharted:BUCK_MODULE schematic symbol (1=IN+ 2=IN- 3=OUT+ 4=OUT-). Rectangular pads mark the '+' nets (IN+, OUT+), matching the square pads printed on the real board next to its own '+' silkscreen -- also serves as the footprint's pin-1 indicator.")
